s song for him one afternoon while he was driving. He was so happy listening to me. An hour later he passed away on his way to perform his prayer. I don\u0027t have the courage to listen to this song for such a long time. But i know that my late husband wants me to keep on living my life with our two handsome boys. This song makes me remember his smile and his last kiss. I miss him so much.","author":{"@type":"https://schema.org/Person","name":"@sitisuhadazainalabidin2392","url":"https://www.youtube.com/@sitisuhadazainalabidin2392","alternateName":"sitisuhada zainalabidin"},"upvoteCount":11459}]}</script><script nonce="usKcwxT5alEgtcuiJVeYzg">if (window.ytcsi) {window.ytcsi.tick('bc', null, '');}var ytimg={count:0,preload:function(src){var img=new Image;var count=++ytimg.count;ytimg[count]=img;img.onload=img.onerror=function(){delete ytimg[count]};img.src=src}};
